       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "ABG"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " if breathing is severe or worsening; a basic metabolic panel's bicarbonate shows how chronic a respiratory acidosis is."
     }
    ]
   },
